n under 1.0%/yr since 2026.\",\"by_when\":\"Mar 31 2031\",\"if_observed_implies\":\"The grid under-build is happening WITHOUT a price impulse -- Wave 1's disinflationary resolution of the AI-Q3/AI-Q4 tension, not mine. Removes my +0.06 to +0.10 pp front-half electricity indirect and, more importantly, removes the trades-scarcity pass-through into shelter (-0.2 pp on core). CQ6 mass shifts ~7 pp from C to D; CQ4 P50 down ~40 bp; CQ3 P50 down ~0.1 pp as the AI TFP contribution shrinks with it.\"}","updateBasis":{"kind":"launch","note":"run1 wave 2 redteam seat, effort 'inflation'."}}